      "writtenOn": "2017-08-30T14:07:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "David: Some MAAS-related setup needs to happen for CiaB.  Currently this is grouped into a playbook + role in the MAAS repo. \n Where would you prefer that it live?\n\nGopi: I don\u0027t see why this tag is necessary.  What\u0027s the idea?",
