      "writtenOn": "2017-08-30T14:44:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "David:   The purpose of CiaB is to provide a vanilla deployment of a CORD POD, without any unnecessary \"customization of the deployment\", but in a virtual environment.  As the main developer of CiaB, I have tried to be sensitive to your first concern.  Concretely, this playbook sets up the PCU in MAAS for controlling virtual machines.  I think that PCU setup is likely to be idiosyncratic based on the environment (CiaB, cloud, physical).\n\nWe want the system to be more modular, as you point out.   I think the new build system is a step in the right direction, however there is clearly more thinking that needs to happen in this area.",
      "parentUuid": "fa5d592f_2a353f46",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 25
      },
